interact with and understand their customers. By leveraging the insights gleaned from big data analytics, companies can develop more targeted, effective, and personalized marketing strategies, thereby enhancing customer satisfaction and loyalty. As the field continues to evolve, it is imperative for businesses to stay abreast of the latest developments and adapt their
