efficiency and effectiveness of marketing strategies in the context of cross-border e-commerce. In conclusion, the existing literature on big data in marketing demonstrates its significant role in transforming marketing strategies. Big data analytics has enabled businesses to gain deeper insights into consumer behavior, develop personalized marketing strategies, and enhance overall marketing efficiency. As the field continues to evolve, there is a need for ongoing
